{"id":"fa971ebc9fa7af70","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition.md","title":"Theorem — 预层指数的转置双射","display":"Theorem — 预层指数的转置双射","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition","aliases":["14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition"],"display":"Theorem — 预层指数的转置双射","source_ref":"I.6, pp.44–47","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-presheaf-exponentials]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 预层指数的转置双射"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.6, pp.44–47"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a56025295f88eafd\" href=\"?note=a56025295f88eafd\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-exponentials\">14-df-presheaf-exponentials</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q,R\">\\(P,Q,R\\)</span> 为同一小范畴上的预层，指数和求值见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a56025295f88eafd\" href=\"?note=a56025295f88eafd\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-exponentials\">14-df-presheaf-exponentials</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:R\\times P\\to Q\">\\(h:R\\times P\\to Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k:R\\to Q^P\">\\(k:R\\to Q^P\\)</span> 为自然变换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:D\\to C\">\\(u:D\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in R(C)\">\\(r\\in R(C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in P(D)\">\\(p\\in P(D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>源小范畴记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde h_C(r)\">\\(\\widetilde h_C(r)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Nat}(yC\\times P,Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{Nat}(yC\\times P,Q)\\)</span> 的元素，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde h\">\\(\\widetilde h\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Nat}(R,Q^P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Nat}(R,Q^P)\\)</span> 的元素，二者均在 Assertion 中按三元组完整组装。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde h_C(r)_D(u,p)=h_D(R(u)r,p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widetilde h_C(r)_D(u,p)=h_D(R(u)r,p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Nat}(R\\times P,Q)\\xrightarrow[\\cong]{h\\mapsto\\widetilde h}\\operatorname{Nat}(R,Q^P),\\qquad k\\mapsto\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(k\\times\\operatorname{id}_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Nat}(R\\times P,Q)\\xrightarrow[\\cong]{h\\mapsto\\widetilde h}\\operatorname{Nat}(R,Q^P),\\qquad k\\mapsto\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(k\\times\\operatorname{id}_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(\\widetilde h\\times\\operatorname{id}_P)=h,\\qquad\\widetilde{\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(k\\times\\operatorname{id}_P)}=k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(\\widetilde h\\times\\operatorname{id}_P)=h,\\qquad\\widetilde{\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(k\\times\\operatorname{id}_P)}=k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde h_C(r):=\\left(yC\\times P,Q,\\left((yC(D)\\times P(D),Q(D),((u,p)\\mapsto h_D(R(u)(r),p)))\\right)_{D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widetilde h_C(r):=\\left(yC\\times P,Q,\\left((yC(D)\\times P(D),Q(D),((u,p)\\mapsto h_D(R(u)(r),p)))\\right)_{D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde h:=\\left(R,Q^P,\\left((R(C),Q^P(C),(r\\mapsto\\widetilde h_C(r)))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widetilde h:=\\left(R,Q^P,\\left((R(C),Q^P(C),(r\\mapsto\\widetilde h_C(r)))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde h_C(r)\">\\(\\widetilde h_C(r)\\)</span> 的自然性由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 的自然性以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(v)R(u)=R(uv)\">\\(R(v)R(u)=R(uv)\\)</span> 导出；它对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的自然性也由该公式直接核对。将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 取恒等箭头得第一逆律。第二逆律在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u,p)\">\\((u,p)\\)</span> 上使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的自然性，再使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_C(r)\">\\(k_C(r)\\)</span> 的自然性，即回到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_C(r)_D(u,p)\">\\(k_C(r)_D(u,p)\\)</span>。因此二者互逆，且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,Q\">\\(R,Q\\)</span> 中的自然变换相容，给出指数的全部泛性质。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.6, pp.44–47。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-presheaf-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"a56025295f88eafd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-exponentials]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"a56025295f88eafd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,Q,R$ 为同一小范畴上的预层，指数和求值见 [[14-df-presheaf-exponentials]]。$h:R\\times P\\to Q$、$k:R\\to Q^P$ 为自然变换；$u:D\\to C$，$r\\in R(C)$，$p\\in P(D)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P,Q,R","display":false},{"tex":"h:R\\times P\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"k:R\\to Q^P","display":false},{"tex":"u:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in R(C)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in P(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde h_C(r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Nat}(yC\\times P,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde h","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Nat}(R,Q^P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde h_C(r)_D(u,p)=h_D(R(u)r,p).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Nat}(R\\times P,Q)\\xrightarrow[\\cong]{h\\mapsto\\widetilde h}\\operatorname{Nat}(R,Q^P),\\qquad k\\mapsto\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(k\\times\\operatorname{id}_P).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(\\widetilde h\\times\\operatorname{id}_P)=h,\\qquad\\widetilde{\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(k\\times\\operatorname{id}_P)}=k.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widetilde h_C(r):=\\left(yC\\times P,Q,\\left((yC(D)\\times P(D),Q(D),((u,p)\\mapsto h_D(R(u)(r),p)))\\right)_{D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\widetilde h:=\\left(R,Q^P,\\left((R(C),Q^P(C),(r\\mapsto\\widetilde h_C(r)))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\widetilde h_C(r)","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"R(v)R(u)=R(uv)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"(u,p)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k_C(r)","display":false},{"tex":"k_C(r)_D(u,p)","display":false},{"tex":"R,Q","display":false}],"bytes":2223,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition|thm-191 — 预层指数的转置双射]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-245","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition|thm-191 — 预层指数的转置双射]]"},{"id":"abb55776f8cac91e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["a56025295f88eafd"]}